solution.p:
And the sum of lifting all of the slices from the bottom (x=0) to the top of the water level's depth (x=4) is
\begin{array}{cl}
\int_0^{4}(9.8)(1050)\left({\frac{4}{9}} \pi x^2\right)(6-x)\,dx  \amp  =10290\left({\frac{4}{9}}\right)\pi\int_0^{4} (6 x^2-x^3)\,dx \\
  \amp    =10290\left({\frac{4}{9}}\right)\pi\left[\frac{6 x^3}{3} - \frac{x^4}{4}\right]_0^{4}  \\
  \amp    =10290\left({\frac{4}{9}}\right)\pi\big[128-64\big]  \\
  \amp    =10290\left({\frac{4}{9}}\right)\pi\big(64\big) \\
 \amp  \approx 919523\;\;\text{J}
\end{array}
